From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:52:33 +1100
Subject: fix: no evolution is started that the game would only stop (#6)

The evolution scene cancels evolutions beyond the first 151 Pokemon until the
National Pokedex. With the easier presets' lower friendship threshold, Chansey
and Golbat started such an evolution after every level-up (about 12 times in
the second half of the QA run). With noEvolutionCancel, such a target is not
returned at all.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNqSDphYuD2Aqe9TExdQMP

diff --git a/src/pokemon.c b/src/pokemon.c
index b4f740354..5a4bebff9 100644
--- a/src/pokemon.c
+++ b/src/pokemon.c
@@ -5117,6 +5117,12 @@ u16 GetEvolutionTargetSpecies(struct Pokemon *mon, u8 type, u16 evolutionItem)
                 break;
             }
         }
+        // Little Trainers: the evolution scene stops any evolution beyond the first 151 Pokemon
+        // until the National Pokedex (Golbat to Crobat, Chansey to Blissey). With the lower
+        // friendship needed on the easier presets that happened after every level-up, so such
+        // an evolution is not started at all.
+        if (LT_Rules()->noEvolutionCancel && !IsNationalPokedexEnabled() && targetSpecies > SPECIES_MEW)
+            targetSpecies = SPECIES_NONE;
         break;
     case EVO_MODE_TRADE:
         for (i = 0; i < EVOS_PER_MON; i++)
